# Autorig Tools UI criteria

Before changing any Maya menu, shelf, or Qt window, read
`maya_tools/criterios-ui.md` and follow it. Do not invent a parallel layout.

Short reminders:

- Menu `AutoRig Tools` groups in this order: Reload UI, PIPELINE,
  MODELING, RIGGING, ANIMATION, CORRECTIVES, SKINNING, SIMULATION.
- Shelf `AutoRig` is the short cut (AssetMgr today). Icons in `maya_tools/icons`.
- Character Manager Qt palette lives in `character_manager.py`. Reuse it.
- New labels: English. See `.cursor/rules/language.mdc`.

Wrong: a second Maya menu, web chrome, or a dump window not on the data map.
